        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: പ്രവചനം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രവചനം — pravacanaṁ — \"a forecast; a prediction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നാളെ കനത്ത മഴ ഉണ്ടാകുമെന്നാണ് പ്രവചനം. nāḷe kanatta maḻa uṇṭākumennāṇŭ pravacanaṁ. The forecast is that there will be heavy rain tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A weather forecast is a കാലാവസ്ഥാ പ്രവചനം (pravacanaṁ)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രവചനം (pravacanaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit pravacana, \"speaking out, announcement\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
